    description: "PlazaFlow spatial audio is a per-peer Web Audio node graph: AudioContext -> GainNode -> StereoPannerNode -> destination, with dynamic gain/pan driven by distance and wall raycasts. Need a YAML-driven framework pattern detecting AudioContext creation, createGain/createStereoPanner/createMediaStreamSource, and .connect() chains. Emit framework pattern nodes for audio graph topology. No existing pattern. Bakeoff repos: dash.js (media player with Web Audio), hls.js (media with audio processing), shaka-player (media). Cross-refs: No existing Web Audio support. Lower priority than linker items — useful for developer understanding but not cross-boundary edge quality."  # a6c8
    fields: {}  # a6c8
