- op: discuss  # d852
  at: '2026-03-18T05:08:54Z'  # d852
  by: agent  # d852
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d852
  clock: 5  # d852
  nonce: d852  # d852
  message: "Scouted all 3 repos for Web Audio API usage:\n\n- **dash.js**: No Web Audio API usage found\n- **hls.js**: No Web Audio API usage found  \n- **shaka-player**: One file (lib/text/speech_to_text.js) — AudioContext + createMediaElementSource + connect() for extracting audio from media elements for speech recognition. Very limited usage.\n\nThese media player repos don't exercise the Web Audio node graph patterns described in the WI (createGain, createStereoPanner, AudioWorklet). The WI's primary use case (PlazaFlow spatial audio: AudioContext → GainNode → StereoPannerNode → destination with dynamic gain/pan) isn't represented here.\n\nThe framework pattern implementation is straightforward but these repos won't validate it meaningfully. Would you like me to: (1) implement anyway and validate against shaka-player's minimal usage, or (2) deprioritize until repos with richer Web Audio graphs are available?"  # d852
