  message: "DEEP bakeoff baseline complete on all 8 Web Audio repos:\n\nCohort 1: Tone.js (GOOD, 12K edges), tuna (WARN, 14 edges), pizzicato (WARN, 37 edges), howler.js (WARN, 63 edges)\nCohort 2: koel (GOOD, 23K edges), nuclear (WARN, 9K edges), omnitone (WARN, 135 edges), resonance-audio-web-sdk (WARN, 645 edges)\n\nKey finding: Tone.js and koel are the richest for analysis. The smaller libraries (tuna, pizzicato, omnitone, resonance-audio-web-sdk) have inherently simple structures. The Web Audio API patterns (AudioContext, connect(), createGain, etc.) are not yet detected as framework patterns — implementing those is the next step."  # 8a56
